DESCRIPTION:Review the Accretion / Dilution Model update and resulting DCF-Solv calculation. Confirm that stock-based compensation equals 3% of operating expenses plus cost of goods sold under the model’s existing methodology and is added back to free cash flow in each forecast year. Verify mid-year discounting\, 1.0% revenue growth from FY2025E through the end of the forecast period\, exclusion of terminal value\, and presentation in USD millions rounded to two decimal places. The meeting is for methodology and output review\; no analytical findings are assumed.
